{
  "era": "wotlk",
  "format": "living-azeroth-npc-summaries",
  "map": 30,
  "npcs": [
    {
      "entry": 12096,
      "name": "Stormpike Quartermaster",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:12096:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:06fe4a1333e9ed7b6e06e1d9",
            "source:b1c8f5ac2f0954c9532314fb",
            "source:84c8b2555728cf8173c40492",
            "source:5249a964426a0ccc10d66622"
          ],
          "text": "The Stormpike Quartermaster supplies the Alliance force in Alterac Valley and wants provisions recovered from the Irondeep mine, which the troops can no longer hold against troggs and the Horde. The quartermaster keeps goods for sale and tracks how many more supplies are needed to send ground assaults.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 12096
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 12097,
      "name": "Frostwolf Quartermaster",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:12097:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:437b4459d20e542e092ba6a4",
            "source:93561c61dd060bb1b910ba72",
            "source:a5558cb851ad98f5ff1774ac",
            "source:d2b8e20111079beb7668c70b",
            "source:a2f9d1b8fca3b3aff1e5a4de"
          ],
          "text": "The Frostwolf Quartermaster supplies the Horde force in Alterac Valley and wants equipment raided from the Stormpike stores in Irondeep mine to curtail their efforts. The quartermaster keeps goods for sale and gives vital tasks to recruits eager to serve the Horde.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 12097
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13151,
      "name": "Syndicate Master Ryson",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13151:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:af9a59d63c91f10a97556bf5",
            "source:2e58f596aecee48b56e10e40",
            "source:79cbcd6880a2ce3b4ac7daf8"
          ],
          "text": "Syndicate Master Ryson regards the war in Alterac as irrelevant to the Syndicate, which intends to wait for a clear victor before striking. He seeks the lost All Seeing Eye, taken by Winterax trolls, and wants to examine those who recover it; he promises the Syndicate's services for whatever time remains to their side.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13151
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13176,
      "name": "Smith Regzar",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13176:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:c59f26926ad43eb45d165564",
            "source:e5d53eff7f161137ce9635b9",
            "source:b68a98d194ae351f949890e9",
            "source:8dfe14b0792fc31f35723111"
          ],
          "text": "Smith Regzar is a Frostwolf smith who melts down captured Stormpike armor scraps and patches them into gear for his troops. He asks for more scraps and offers to polish a visitor's armor.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13176
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13179,
      "name": "Wing Commander Guse",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13179:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:36485a0dd7d4978be8822abc",
            "source:a7e021a95b0eb69a2eb34775"
          ],
          "text": "Wing Commander Guse is preparing his War Rider fleet for a strike on the central battlefield. He wants Stormpike soldier flesh to feed the riders before their assault, and describes the fleet as nearing flight once its preparations are complete.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13179
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13180,
      "name": "Wing Commander Jeztor",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13180:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:17db888feaa1a1519cb231c1",
            "source:4fb76e9e7830090283876850"
          ],
          "text": "Wing Commander Jeztor is preparing his War Rider fleet for a surgical strike. He describes it as the second most powerful fleet in the air command, assigning it powerful targets; he seeks Stormpike lieutenant flesh to condition the riders for that task.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13180
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13181,
      "name": "Wing Commander Mulverick",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13181:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:6974d10af239a3f6bf87d1f6",
            "source:f57f6f6f699ab20f189975e1"
          ],
          "text": "Wing Commander Mulverick says he was held for days in a dwarven prison and wants revenge. He plans carefully, choosing Stormpike commanders as high-priority targets for his War Riders, whose riders he means to prepare with their flesh; he warns that reaching them means operating deep behind enemy lines.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13181
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13236,
      "name": "Primalist Thurloga",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13236:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:a392eb5dc4c69edaa68ff66b",
            "source:d79472c7b6da586ac6106180"
          ],
          "text": "Primalist Thurloga came from Thunder Bluff to aid the Frostwolf Clan at Cairne's direction. She oversees the blood offering for the summoning ritual, mixing gathered enemy blood so the Ice Lord can be unleashed against the Stormpike army.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13236
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13257,
      "name": "Murgot Deepforge",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13257:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:603561f7047cb00ba4c51a7a",
            "source:87aceabfb7ca6cfae63fe8cc",
            "source:8bdf0c00c8ab50e18fd73ebe"
          ],
          "text": "Murgot Deepforge gathers armor scraps from the battlefield to fashion equipment for his troops, since the supplies from Ironforge cannot outfit the experienced soldiers well enough. He hopes that once his supplies are high enough, seasoned fighting units will enter the field.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13257
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13377,
      "name": "Master Engineer Zinfizzlex",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13377:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:e5c8f729a63a5c5f6135beda",
            "source:2c9491c6eced8a18befb799c"
          ],
          "text": "Master Engineer Zinfizzlex is developing a portable shredder unit and needs large quantities of thorium, mithril, and iron, plus a steamsaw for each kit. He says he spotted steamsaws at a lumber camp while exploring before his capture, making the machine a practical project shaped by his time behind enemy lines.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13377
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13437,
      "name": "Wing Commander Ichman",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13437:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:486cd2dacb80a34f784d55dc",
            "source:f016224844ed8c3aaa3172c8",
            "source:11107c70a50e256f3547c24a"
          ],
          "text": "Wing Commander Ichman leads a Stormpike gryphon flight. He says Mulverick shot him down and fears his squad will be lost if he cannot return to base. After a failed air strike left his gryphons unwilling to fly, he seeks medals from Frostwolf commanders and guardians to restore their morale.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13437
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13438,
      "name": "Wing Commander Slidore",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13438:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:5d89a50bfbe120503004517b",
            "source:608271261b1bb8b2a9915996",
            "source:0d7d386b6c2adb3730aaa7e6"
          ],
          "text": "Wing Commander Slidore commands an Aerie gryphon flight poised to attack the Frostwolf front. He says his gryphons must wait until the enemy line is thinned, and directs the effort against its warriors, whose service medals are sought as proof of progress.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13438
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13439,
      "name": "Wing Commander Vipore",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13439:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:391f8f958a6d06c0e2f3c568",
            "source:ec1e1cdf06a73acc7d6b647c",
            "source:8d18807bce41354dc3780fa5"
          ],
          "text": "Wing Commander Vipore leads a Stormpike flight and sets his soldiers to thin out the Frostwolf lieutenants and legionnaires before he deploys an air strike. He tells of a reconnaissance flight in which Mulverick brought down Ichman and Slidore; Vipore broke formation to pursue Mulverick, was forced down himself, and was captured.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13439
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13441,
      "name": "Frostwolf Wolf Rider Commander",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13441:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:dab83780c75eb44cf2edac7a",
            "source:fd008ef6158ddf12b68a3137"
          ],
          "text": "A Frostwolf wolf-rider commander organizes supplies for the riders. He seeks ram hides to make riding harnesses, explaining that the Frostwolf Wolf Riders will ride once enough hides have been gathered.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13441
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13442,
      "name": "Arch Druid Renferal",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13442:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:7b62acd2cf940e8a71af0839",
            "source:c15fe50d9beb03e176a71799",
            "source:21b0954d9351be01e4f931f7",
            "source:580eaf42363571ccbf62861e"
          ],
          "text": "Arch Druid Renferal gathers storm crystals and charms for the Circle, strengthening their stored magic until she can call Ivus the Forest Lord to aid the cause. She trusts that Ivus will answer her faith.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13442
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13446,
      "name": "Field Marshal Teravaine",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13446:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:a73070a25bc119f04ba80a12",
            "source:69bc85e9ec5cc28b87b4f6b9"
          ],
          "text": "Field Marshal Teravaine commands troops prepared for an assault in Alterac Valley. He waits for Noreg Stormpike’s orders, then eagerly takes the authorization as his cue to attack.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13446
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13448,
      "name": "Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13448:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:7170de119eec72276a68705a",
            "source:5364c1c8f5ee0c66b9996855",
            "source:35859ef18089485d87c4c8ad"
          ],
          "text": "Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl issues a bounty targeting opposing dwarves in Alterac Valley and demands their spines as proof. Her grim humor turns personal when she reflects that one never forgets their first de-spining.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13448
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13449,
      "name": "Warmaster Garrick",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13449:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:d5bc8137fd13b45694cea9a4"
          ],
          "text": "Warmaster Garrick is eager to launch an attack in Alterac Valley and believes the Alliance will regret entering the battle.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13449
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13577,
      "name": "Stormpike Ram Rider Commander",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13577:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:d7a2613f718d252fb5fc98cf"
          ],
          "text": "A Stormpike commander responsible for preparing the cavalry’s mounts, this ram rider asks for Frostwolf hides to make harnesses. The request reflects a practical priority: the rams near the base are needed as mounts, so the Stormpike should take hides from enemy mounts instead.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13577
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13597,
      "name": "Frostwolf Explosives Expert",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13597:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:2acb50102dee309e1311381b"
          ],
          "text": "A Frostwolf explosives expert who says he lays mines along the front lines, this soldier directs a strike against the Stormpike expert as the way to keep their minefields from being restored. He offers a reward for reporting the rival’s defeat.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13597
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13598,
      "name": "Stormpike Explosives Expert",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13598:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:7e40992c24d002690a6bf665"
          ],
          "text": "A Stormpike explosives expert who warns that Frostwolf front lines and bases are mined, this specialist directs an attack on the opposing expert to keep the mines from returning. The exchange presents the two experts as rival sources of their factions’ mine defenses.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13598
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13616,
      "name": "Frostwolf Stable Master",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13616:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:941eebe809690ec7ffb505ac",
            "source:38c0f73f1a9682300310230b",
            "source:49f82f88a524ffc0ba49b9c3",
            "source:a8a71513bf1f7a700b11e632",
            "source:4fe12c5f2867a2e20c8615b4"
          ],
          "text": "A Frostwolf stable master who helps rebuild the Wolf Riders’ mounts during the war in Alterac Valley. The stable master recruits nearby frostwolves for the stables and can assist with pet stabling and lost companions.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13616
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Stable Master"
    },
    {
      "entry": 13617,
      "name": "Stormpike Stable Master",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13617:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:205988997c6fe2f6ff21a059",
            "source:628e9756e61ff53ed0b095e6",
            "source:4340346c5105229789970b75",
            "source:3c05de1fefaa378eb05b1168"
          ],
          "text": "The Stormpike Stable Master oversees the brigade’s ram stables in Alterac Valley. With the stables empty and the cavalry without mounts, the stable master asks recruits to capture wild rams and return them for stabling so the Stormpike Ram Riders can be rebuilt.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13617
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Stable Master"
    },
    {
      "entry": 13797,
      "name": "Mountaineer Boombellow",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13797:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:fe1cb17cfc365d840aa8b582",
            "source:8ec3a11a7140f3bf34952277"
          ],
          "text": "Mountaineer Boombellow directs new Stormpike recruits to the Stormpike Quartermaster, who waits west along the road and needs supplies from caches stored in Alterac's mines.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13797
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13798,
      "name": "Jotek",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13798:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:5588ab357484589df7c6d83b",
            "source:a46c9ca06347f1bf7a1bd01e"
          ],
          "text": "Jotek is a named humanoid.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13798
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 14185,
      "name": "Najak Hexxen",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:14185:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:bfd9495be947607d230c5932",
            "source:6b3c7532f10e77709eba474c",
            "source:0fe08cfa94e92e7585c66b35",
            "source:4f92c5f96cd519e13ecd21b4"
          ],
          "text": "Najak Hexxen is a Darkspear bounty hunter who urges vengeance against night elves, whom he accuses of seeking to destroy the trolls. He offers Darkspear favor for killing and decapitating opposing night elf combatants in Alterac Valley, and treats each bounty as a small part of a larger conflict.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 14185
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
      "entry": 14186,
      "name": "Ravak Grimtotem",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:14186:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:86dc4624fd741b418ceda7fc",
            "source:62e7d05671dc0ef5138bf2b2",
            "source:31e0ec5025d6ee065dd0a51a",
            "source:3677350f1401c6d48429b53e"
          ],
          "text": "Ravak Grimtotem is a tauren bounty hunter sent by Magatha to study other races, with particular interest in gnomes’ survivability. He considers them physically weak but notably resilient, and recruits help collecting their hair as research samples. He offers those who aid Magatha the standing of allies to the tauren.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 14186
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
      "entry": 14188,
      "name": "Dirk Swindle",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:14188:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:2ff903c5cbc726ef69b79324",
            "source:f3a31ed6edf71aef06888265",
            "source:49d57176a94765af18d21c6d",
            "source:7349fe6836a5cca586a8d057"
          ],
          "text": "Dirk Swindle is a bounty hunter in Alterac Valley. When a hoof is turned in for his bounty, he tosses it onto a pile behind him.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 14188
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Bounty Hunter"
    }
  ],
  "place": "Alterac Valley",
  "place_records": [
    {
      "authored": false,
      "id": "zone:2597",
      "layer": "zone",
      "priority": 40,
      "sources": [
        "dbc:area:2597",
        "world:quest:6847",
        "world:creature:13236",
        "world:creature:13257",
        "world:creature:13437",
        "world:creature:13179",
        "world:quest:5893",
        "world:quest:6985"
      ],
      "text": "You are in Alterac Valley, a battlefield in the heart of Alterac where Alliance and Horde forces fight a war. Primalist Thurloga is helping the Frostwolf Clan summon the Ice Lord to unleash against the Stormpike army of the Alliance. Winterax trolls of the region hold the lost All Seeing Eye. Irondeep and Coldtooth mines, storage depots for both sides, change hands as the fighting shifts, and War Rider and gryphon fleets are being readied for attacks.",
      "when": {
        "zone_id": 2597
      }
    }
  ],
